    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n110865" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φῐλᾰπεχθ-ήμων</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, gen. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ονος</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>fond of making enemies,
				quarrelsome,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				24.24
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				8.65
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				24.6
			</span></i>: 
				Sup.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Jul.
				<u>Mis.</u>
				342d
			</span></i>. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-νως, ἔχειν</span> to be <i>quarrelsome,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				500b
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρός τινα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					2.381
				</span></i>
			. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ής, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,</span>
			= foreg., <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				12.25.6
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λοιδορία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					5.28.4
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-θῶς, κατηγορεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					32.10.3
				</span></i>
			.</div>
